<title>GERMANY: GRUNDIG RESULTS IN LINE WITH PLAN.</title>
<headline>GRUNDIG RESULTS IN LINE WITH PLAN.</headline>
<dateline>FUERTH, Germany 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grundig AG [GRNG.CN] said on Monday it was unaffected by parent company Philips Electronics NV's profit warning and that its own results are in line with plans.</p>
<p>No further restructuring steps are planned at Grundig, particularly regarding the work force, it said.</p>
